{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37188","headline":"报颜标 · 姚岩杰","name":"报颜标","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爲报颜公识我麽，我心唯只与天和。\n眼前俗物关情少，醉後青山入意多。\n田子莫嫌弹铗恨，甯生休唱饭牛歌。\n圣朝若爲苍生计，也合公车到薜萝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚岩杰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37188.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37188","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}